?t=1736693654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight through dungeons</h2>Use your gun to fight through randomly generated dungeons and slay bosses.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529710/extras/220fe651077ebd6bb1364433bb23d0a5.avif?t=1736693654\" width=600 height=69 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529710/extras/48f0bf6524737c7eb636e8dd73557b3b.poster.avif?t=1736693654\" width=600 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529710/extras/48f0bf6524737c7eb636e8dd73557b3b.webm?t=1736693654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529710/extras/48f0bf6524737c7eb636e8dd73557b3b.mp4?t=1736693654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gather Modules</h2>Fight through encounters and collect modules to enhance your gun<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529710/extras/321617d7843c14fc1b49973de5ce1faa.avif?t=1736693654\" width=600 height=69 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529710/extras/e4ca467ef2fd5cd3adcd26feef5107ab.poster.avif?t=1736693654\" width=600 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529710/extras/e4ca467ef2fd5cd3adcd26feef5107ab.webm?t=1736693654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529710/extras/e4ca467ef2fd5cd3adcd26feef5107ab.mp4?t=1736693654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Perma-death</h2>This game is a rogue-like, without permanent character upgrades. There is a progression system. Every unsuccessful run isn't a waste, you unlock more modules you can get, you build up your start lobby and get cosmetics, but it woun't effect the difficulty.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529710/extras/4ae97bedd626021c15e14ea5ede890b3.avif?t=1736693654\" width=600 height=69 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529710/extras/6d10107756988e9437541cc02779ca73.poster.avif?t=1736693654\" width=600 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529710/extras/6d10107756988e9437541cc02779ca73.webm?t=1736693654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529710/extras/6d10107756988e9437541cc02779ca73.mp4?t=1736693654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Slay bosses</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529710/extras/9f0071ec57ed6f8eade28282fbab4dbd.avif?t=1736693654\" width=600 height=69 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529710/extras/7081d5e6ce864903cdc121d22032a00b.poster.avif?t=1736693654\" width=600 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529710/extras/7081d5e6ce864903cdc121d22032a00b.webm?t=1736693654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529710/extras/7081d5e6ce864903cdc121d22032a00b.mp4?t=1736693654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Movement</h2>This game has a physics based movement system and you can fluidly move, dodge and chase down enemies.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529710/extras/5ffe3d4857ad7cbab381a5bcfa97892a.webp?t=1736693654\" width=600 height=38 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529710/extras/0440ba2e2d825627f9aaf54d0b07aaa5.avif?t=1736693654\" width=600 height=78 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >More information</h2>This game is a action FPS rogue-like with perma-death, but the twist is that you build your own gun. Starting from a small pistol you add modules and create any type of gun you want. Shotgun, Sniper-Rifle, SMG, burst gun, laser gun, homing missile rocket launcher, poisonous flamethrower with lightning... why not all of these at once?<br><br><br>Every run fight through dungeons, gather modules, slay bosses and ultimately win or die and go again. On death you lose your modules and your gun build, this is not a rogue-lite, there aren't any permanent upgrades, but worry not. Each atempt you can unlock new modules, upgrade your start lobby, gain cosmetics and most importantly the knowledge and skill to get further through the dungeon.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2529710?t=1736693654","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2529710?t=1736693654","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529710/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1736693654","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529710/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1736693654","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2668120,"